{{!
  JPA entity: the table row, separate from the domain entity. Built from the domain object through a
  package-private constructor and turned back with toDomain() (the domain's builder).
  IDENTITY id (BIGSERIAL in the migration); a domain identifier such as externalId is just another field.
  Exemplars: report-adapter .../repository/ReportCollectionJpaEntity.java,
             authentication-adapter .../repository/entity/BlockedAudienceEntity.java
  Target: <capability>-adapter/src/main/java/<pkg>/adapter/repository/<Name>JpaEntity.java
  Package: "package" is the full package of the file (no suffix is appended).
  Vars:   package, Name, domainPackage, table, imports[],
          fields[type, name, Cap, column, nullable (bool)]
  Left to you: relations (@OneToMany ... orphanRemoval, as ReportCollectionJpaEntity), converters, update-in-place.
}}
